{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Hey Audrey! What's up? Last weekend my girlfriend and I went fishing in one of the nearby lakes. It was so nice. We got a few fish and had a blast. Have you ever gone fishing before?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-fb051d777a1e5e4b21962a7a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.797629+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fb051d777a1e5e4b21962a7a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fb051d777a1e5e4b21962a7a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Hey! Actually I've never been fishing. It's always been just chilling at the lake. I remember this moment a few years back when I sat by a gorgeous lake in the mountains with friends. So peaceful and calming. Just the sound of the birds, the stillness of the water, and the fresh air - it was so special. But yeah I have never gone on a fishing trip before. Here's a photo of the trip to the lake with my friend."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-b45f726eb6c8725e151f5af8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.831874+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b45f726eb6c8725e151f5af8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b45f726eb6c8725e151f5af8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Wow, they look like they're loving the mountain life. How do you keep them looking good out there?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-ad0b7738452152d1bdc3e7ec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.856695+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ad0b7738452152d1bdc3e7ec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ad0b7738452152d1bdc3e7ec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yeah they really do enjoy the mountain life. Regular grooming is essential to keep them looking good. Daily brushing, regular baths, nail trims, and lots of love is what helps them stay healthy and happy. It's all about keeping them in good shape."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-ff6f6423075fe2be37a68020", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.874376+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ff6f6423075fe2be37a68020", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ff6f6423075fe2be37a68020", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Awesome! Sounds like you're doing a great job taking care of them. Making sure they stay healthy and happy is key."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-e6dab26749bb6d1f6cb31cab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.893568+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e6dab26749bb6d1f6cb31cab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e6dab26749bb6d1f6cb31cab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yeah! It means a lot. Taking care of them is a big deal. It makes me really happy and I take that responsibility seriously. It can be tough but it's super rewarding."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-a2cb497cb148fefe5b7d212c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.913280+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a2cb497cb148fefe5b7d212c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a2cb497cb148fefe5b7d212c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: I'm sure it's rewarding. Making a positive impact on someone's life, especially those close to you, must be such a good feeling."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-4c5408a49a948110d0739a0d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.930008+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4c5408a49a948110d0739a0d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4c5408a49a948110d0739a0d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yeah, my dogs make me really happy. I love them so much and I want to make them as happy as possible. We have a strong bond."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-48120f2ceb19273000aacf02", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.945041+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "48120f2ceb19273000aacf02", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "48120f2ceb19273000aacf02", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: That's amazing. You have such a strong bond with them! I hope I can have such a strong bond with Toby as well."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-4f4ffa38d8df14f8037e5967", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.960220+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4f4ffa38d8df14f8037e5967", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4f4ffa38d8df14f8037e5967", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: They mean the world to me. I'm so lucky to have them. I sure with your love, you and Toby can have a strong bond."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-3b9a630dd13b4cdae4f4c291", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.979706+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3b9a630dd13b4cdae4f4c291", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3b9a630dd13b4cdae4f4c291", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Lucky you! Pets sure bring a lot of love and joy. Can't wait till Toby and I bond better."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-14f8a6f17bee817319201ebb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:48.992912+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "14f8a6f17bee817319201ebb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "14f8a6f17bee817319201ebb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Thanks! That's really nice. Let me know if you need some tips on taking care of Toby."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-a758eae542078edd287e9078", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:49.010954+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a758eae542078edd287e9078", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a758eae542078edd287e9078", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Sure thing! I'll try figure it on my own first. Appreciate the help!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-049a143c9a65871d047c16bb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:49.029418+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "049a143c9a65871d047c16bb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "049a143c9a65871d047c16bb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Remember, it takes time to form a bond, don't rush!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-3ac9b532051017245c4aba39", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:49.047539+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3ac9b532051017245c4aba39", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3ac9b532051017245c4aba39", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Got it. Thanks for that reminder."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-7ec1d70857060ea801b6784b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:49.059538+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7ec1d70857060ea801b6784b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7ec1d70857060ea801b6784b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: No problem. Let me know if you have any questions or need advice."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-f0ff95d52c77a1c083ed0bd2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:49.074881+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f0ff95d52c77a1c083ed0bd2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f0ff95d52c77a1c083ed0bd2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Yep, Audrey. Thanks for everything - you rock! Here's a pic of Toby."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-09a6c0a01766a8dbdbd8edf7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:49.087334+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "09a6c0a01766a8dbdbd8edf7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "09a6c0a01766a8dbdbd8edf7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Aww so cute! Toby looks happy!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-c14c50da030ddfd00058d3e9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:49.099356+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c14c50da030ddfd00058d3e9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c14c50da030ddfd00058d3e9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Haha yeah, I do love Toby!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-9da0ea3802929ad2b98ec7c4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:49.117582+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9da0ea3802929ad2b98ec7c4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9da0ea3802929ad2b98ec7c4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: I'm glad Toby is happy. I'm sure there are lots of adventures to come!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-bfbb7ab9c6558515b6530029", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:49.132712+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bfbb7ab9c6558515b6530029", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bfbb7ab9c6558515b6530029", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Yep, Toby and I are gonna have a blast exploring outdoors! Can't wait."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-44/session_17-e3951338b05d86d16a4ee31a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:36:49.151295+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e3951338b05d86d16a4ee31a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e3951338b05d86d16a4ee31a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
